#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/fltk.xml:108
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of FLTK"
msgstr "Instalação do FLTK"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/fltk.xml:112
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The tar extraction directory is fltk-&fltk-version; and not fltk-&fltk-"
"version;-source as indicated by the tarball name."
msgstr ""
"O diretório de extração &quot;tar&quot; é &quot;fltk-&fltk-version;&quot; e "
"não &quot;fltk-&fltk-version;-source&quot; conforme indicado pelo nome do "
"&quot;tarball&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/fltk.xml:118
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>FLTK</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>FLTK</application>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/fltk.xml:122
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr \\\n"
"      -D FLTK_BUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release  \\\n"
"      -G \"Ninja\" ..                &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr \\\n"
"      -D FLTK_BUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release  \\\n"
"      -G \"Ninja\" ..                &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/fltk.xml:132
#, xml-text
msgid "If you wish to create the API documentation, issue:"
msgstr ""
"Se você deseja criar a documentação da &quot;API&quot;, [então] emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/fltk.xml:135
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja documentation/html</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja documentation/html</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/fltk.xml:138
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The tests for the package are interactive.  To execute the tests, run "
"<command>bin/test/unittests</command>. In addition, there are about 110 "
"other executable test programs in the <filename "
"class='directory'>bin/test</filename> directory that can be run "
"individually."
msgstr ""
"Os testes para o pacote são interativos. Para executar os testes, execute "
"<command>bin/test/unittests</command>. Além disso, existem cerca de 110 "
"outros programas executáveis de teste no diretório <filename "
"class='directory'>bin/test</filename> que podem ser executados "
"individualmente."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/fltk.xml:146
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Now, install the package and remove unneeded static libraries.  As the "
"&root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, instale o pacote e remova bibliotecas estáticas desnecessárias. Como "
"o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/fltk.xml:150
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>ninja install &amp;&amp;\n"
"rm -vf /usr/lib/libfltk*.a</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>ninja install &amp;&amp;\n"
"rm -vf /usr/lib/libfltk*.a</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/fltk.xml:154
#, xml-text
msgid "If you have built the documentation, install it as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver construído a documentação, instale-a como o(a) usuário(a) "
"&root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/fltk.xml:158
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -vdm 755          /usr/share/doc/fltk-&fltk-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -Rv documentation/html /usr/share/doc/fltk-&fltk-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -vdm 755          /usr/share/doc/fltk-&fltk-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -Rv documentation/html /usr/share/doc/fltk-&fltk-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/fltk.xml:162
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Otherwise, if you downloaded the optional html documentation, install it as "
"the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Do contrário, se você baixou a documentação HTML opcional, instale-a como "
"o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/fltk.xml:166
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -vdm 755 /usr/share/doc/fltk-&fltk-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"tar -C /usr/share/doc/fltk-&fltk-version; --strip-components=4 -xf ../../fltk-&fltk-version;-docs-html.tar.gz</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -vdm 755 /usr/share/doc/fltk-&fltk-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"tar -C /usr/share/doc/fltk-&fltk-version; --strip-components=4 -xf ../../fltk-&fltk-version;-docs-html.tar.gz</userinput>"

